  "description": "A young beekeeper in the countryside, Yeon-Woo spends his free time drinking out of frustration. That is until he gets too drunk to remember signing a contract to rent out his house as a filming location for a variety show. Now Yeon-Woo finds himself sharing space with kind and handsome star actor Do-Jun Kang. Will this city transplant and country mouse’s budding bromance survive beyond 10 days of shooting?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
